{"resourceIdentifier":"4256","resourceName":"Linzhang Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project","description":"This project is a step towards supporting disposal and comprehensive utilization of animal waste in Hebei Province, one of the agriculture production bases in North China. This project has installed an environmentally friendly manure treatment solution: a system to produce bio-natural gas through plug-in dry fermentation treatment of manure collected from local livestock farms. Solid bio-organic fertilizer and liquid fertilizer are the by-products. The bio-natural gas is to be used in the transportation sector to displace traditional fossil CNG. \r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, manure is stored at individual livestock farms in uncovered anaerobic lagoons over a retention period of a couple of months before they were used for agriculture application as fertilizer, directly without any treatment. Significant amount of Greenhouse Gases (GHG), such as methane could be emitted directly into the atmosphere. \r\nFrom the perspective of bio-CNG produced by this project, without the project the fossil origin CNG would be continuously used by the transportation applications. \r\nThe successful implementation of the project prevents GHG emissions, methane in particular, as well as generate a clean renewable energy that displaces fossil fuel CNG.","location":{"latitude":36.357950,"longitude":114.435681},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-05-08","endExclusive":"2023-06-08","endInclusive":"2023-06-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4256"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hebei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhonghuan Xinwei Green Technology (Lin Zhang) Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hebei, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86-10-13810420986"},{"type":"string","value":"jimmychrist@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"151849"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073,AMS-III.AQ"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10/09/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/02/2022 - 31/01/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=89736&IDKEY=9iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf3123745944","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4256_03APR2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-05-08T23:46:42.187Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=86532&IDKEY=oiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3m119327628","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation to be signed.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-16T03:53:14.527Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=118563&IDKEY=s8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0r163498377","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"Linzhang Biogas Project_VCS_Joint PDMR_v1.6_Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-09-10T22:18:43.557Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=106120&IDKEY=olksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku0980146339480","documentType":"Registration 